title: "Estimating Cross-Platform Usage Structure from Large-Scale Marginal Distributions and a Small Panel"
description: >-
  Fuse large-scale service logs with a small single-source panel using a Gaussian copula to estimate cross-media audience overlap and complementarity.
draft: true
